criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
Lipedema: Diagnosis of lipedema, BMI < 30 kg/m2, waist < 80 cm;
Adiposity: BMI > 35 kg/m2, waist > 100 cm;
Normalweight non-lipedema: BMI < 30 kg/m2, waist < 80 cm
Exclusion criteria:
restrains in communication skills; diseases that affect the sensory nervous system, skin issitations at the testing areas; topical application of analgesics at the testing areas, alterations in pain perception or other diagnoses of chronic pain
